{"nodes": [{"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "label": "chooseLinker (linker.go)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The pairing paradigm is chosen once at construction behind the linker interface, so the daemon never branches on mode inline: managedLinker when the box can reach a pool (direct wak_ key or vesta.run server-identity path), else qrLinker."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_managedlinker", "label": "managedLinker (linker.go)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_qrlinker", "label": "qrLinker (linker.go)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_guardedpairphone", "label": "guardedPairPhone (linker.go)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every managed PairPhone runs through the same ban-avoidance rate-limit guard as the phone path: checkPairAttempt BEFORE minting a code (a blocked cap returns rate_limited and never pairs) and recordPairAttempt only on a generated code, so a failing number cannot issue unbounded real pairing requests and a failed pre-connection attempt records nothing."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_managed_auth_managedauth", "label": "managedAuth HTTP client (managed_auth.go)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Hides the three-credential selection: cloud mode mints a vestad server-identity token, direct mode uses a per-account wak_ key against DOUBLETICK_API_URL; the paths and payloads are identical either way."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_doc", "label": "Managed WhatsApp Auth Doc", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "label": "Managed Auth Strategy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provisioning is lazy and agent-initiated: every paid account is entitled to exactly one number, but it is claimed only when the agent actually needs WhatsApp, so a user who never uses WhatsApp never gets one. Selection: a hosted box with no linked WhatsApp uses managed; otherwise QR. Egress hardfails on datacenter IPs, leasing a residential proxy from doubletick when needed."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_server_identity_token", "label": "Server-Identity Token (WhatsApp pool)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In cloud mode the agent holds no WhatsApp secret: vestad signs a short-lived token locally from the box api_key (no network call), and vesta.run is a pure auth-forward that verifies the token plus the paid-membership gate then passes the request to the home box verbatim, adding no API of its own."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_doubletick_pool_api", "label": "Doubletick Pool API", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One pool API on the home box with two native paths (/provision, /pair) and two interchangeable ways to reach it (via vesta.run or direct with a wak_ key). /provision is idempotent so reauth re-consults it, which is what lets a post-link ban recover: the control plane auto-heals a banned account onto a fresh number."}, {"id": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_reply_first_posture", "label": "Reply-First Anti-Ban Posture", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A live run proved the flow works mechanically but a freshly-provisioned account was banned within ~15 minutes; the trigger was the maximum-risk profile (minutes-old number, non-official whatsmeow client, immediate cold message to a non-contact). The blocker for managed WhatsApp is account trust, not plumbing, so: never cold-initiate (the user texts the agent first via a prefilled wa.me opener), warm up before volume, prefer aged pool numbers over fresh SIMs."}], "edges": [{"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_doc", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_doubletick_pool_api", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_server_identity_token", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_reply_first_posture", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_doc", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_doc", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_guardedpairphone", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_doc", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_state_statestore", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_managedlinker", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_qrlinker", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_managedlinker", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_managed_auth_managedauth", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_server_identity_token", "target": "agent_skills_vesta_cloud_account_skill_server_identity_token", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "agent_skills_whatsapp_skill_connect_verb", "target": "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "managed_whatsapp_provisioning_flow", "label": "Managed WhatsApp Provisioning Flow", "nodes": ["agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_managed_auth_strategy", "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_server_identity_token", "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_doubletick_pool_api", "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_chooselinker", "agent_skills_whatsapp_cli_linker_managedlinker", "agent_skills_whatsapp_managed_auth_reply_first_posture"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "agent/skills/whatsapp/MANAGED_AUTH.md"}]}